#. (itstool) path: plugin/_short
msgid "Preserve Output"
msgstr "保留输出"

#. (itstool) path: plugin/_long
msgid ""
"A plugin to restore windows to their original position if outputs are "
"temporarily disconnected."
msgstr "在输出暂时断开时将窗口恢复到原始位置的插件。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Last output focus timeout"
msgstr "最后聚焦输出超时"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Length of time in milliseconds to remember a destroyed output as the last "
"output with focus, before it can be overridden by another destroyed output "
"with focus."
msgstr "将已销毁的输出记为最后聚焦输出的保留时间（毫秒），超过后可能被另一个已销毁的聚焦输出覆盖。"
